    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Compare survival, developmental stage, skeletal-rod mineralization and arm length between control and calcium-depleted sea-urchin larvae. The claim is supported by viable stage-matched larvae lacking rods and long arms specifically under calcium depletion.";
